0.02em;\">Can Chris speak at my association's event?</h2>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.65; color: #333333;\">Chris gives practical, research-based talks on membership growth, marketing and sales automation, AI use, and transformative culture for associations.</p>\n\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; padding-top: 6px;\"><a href=\"/lets-talk/\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: rgb(4, 31, 51); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-radius: 999px; padding: 13px 24px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; text-decoration: none\">Invite Chris to speak</a></div>\n</div></div></section>\n<section style=\"background: #041F33; font-family: 'PT Sans', -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #FFFFFF;\">\n<div style=\"max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 48px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; align-items: flex-start;\">\n<div style=\"width: 96px; height: 5px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #D91A36 0%, #D91A36 10%, #E8763A 46%, #F0A500 86%, #F0A500 100%);\"></div>\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0; max-width: 820px; font-family: 'PT Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 64px; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #FFFFFF;\">Let's talk about your association</h2>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; max-width: 640px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.78);\">Bring your toughest question. We'll help you find the next step.</p>\n<a href=\"https://www.schedulechris.com\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 52px; padding: 0 28px; background: #D91A36; color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 18px; text-decoration: none;\">Meet with us</a>\n</div>\n</section>\n<footer style=\"background: #041F33; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16); font-family: 'PT Sans', -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #FFFFFF;\">\n<div style=\"max-wi